WEBVTT

01:25.125 --> 01:27.458
Don't arrest me.

01:28.500 --> 01:31.583
No photos. Please, don't arrest me.

01:31.750 --> 01:33.291
They would like to take
a picture with you.

01:33.375 --> 01:35.083
-Are they going to pay?
-Yes.

01:35.750 --> 01:37.750
Hey, what's going on?

01:37.833 --> 01:39.333
I brought porcelain from China.

01:39.416 --> 01:41.125
So many. Ask if they're interested.

01:41.375 --> 01:42.791
Share with me what you earn.

01:45.750 --> 01:47.250
These objects are 7,000 years old.

01:47.333 --> 01:48.500
Very good.

01:48.583 --> 01:51.041
Tell them we accept foreign currency.

01:51.583 --> 01:53.208
And credit cards as well.

01:53.541 --> 01:55.541
Look, very cheap T-shirts.

01:59.791 --> 02:02.500
-You...
-Shameless. You trick foreigners.

02:02.708 --> 02:04.833
It's not cheating. I'm just smart.

02:05.000 --> 02:07.458
-You're competing with me?
-You're crazy. The customers aren't yours.

02:11.208 --> 02:13.291
What are you doing? This is not a market.

02:13.458 --> 02:14.750
Run!

02:14.833 --> 02:16.416
Police! Run!

02:16.500 --> 02:17.833
Go away.

02:19.791 --> 02:22.125
Leave them. We got a call
from the headquarters. Let's go.

02:23.708 --> 02:26.375
Hey, everybody. Look.

02:26.458 --> 02:28.166
What is he doing now?

02:29.000 --> 02:31.166
Take a picture. Quick, here.

02:33.583 --> 02:36.083
I'm lucky I wasn't caught.

02:36.583 --> 02:37.875
Romeo, there's a call for you.

02:37.958 --> 02:39.958
-This is Romeo, who is it?
-This is Romeo, who is it?

02:41.041 --> 02:42.083
I'm here.

02:42.916 --> 02:43.958
It's for me.

02:44.041 --> 02:46.666
Hi, Chen. What's up?

02:46.750 --> 02:48.791
Shen, I'm getting married.

02:48.958 --> 02:51.875
What? I love you so much. How could you?

02:52.250 --> 02:56.666
My mom said I must marry a rich man.
Love is useless.

02:57.000 --> 02:59.500
You're kidding, right? Calm down.

02:59.583 --> 03:01.541
I'm coming for you. Where are you?

03:01.791 --> 03:03.583
-Chen?
-Chen, hurry up.

03:03.666 --> 03:05.500
I have to go. I'm late.

03:05.583 --> 03:06.416
So be it.

03:07.750 --> 03:09.916
Chen, no! I beg you!

03:23.625 --> 03:27.666
I'm in a hurry for the wedding.

03:27.750 --> 03:28.958
Hey!

03:30.791 --> 03:32.208
Sir!

03:33.541 --> 03:34.708
Sir!

03:34.791 --> 03:35.750
What's up, little friend?

03:35.833 --> 03:37.583
Open it for me, please.

03:37.666 --> 03:39.041
No problem. Hold on.

03:42.333 --> 03:45.041
Mom, hurry. I got a taxi.

03:45.583 --> 03:46.958
Get out of my way.

03:49.250 --> 03:50.458
Hey!

03:51.125 --> 03:53.625
You're an adult,
but you got fooled by a kid.

03:53.750 --> 03:54.666
Shame on you.

04:10.208 --> 04:11.500
Go.

04:14.916 --> 04:16.041
Do you have red bean ice cream?

04:16.125 --> 04:17.083
No, we don't.

04:17.166 --> 04:18.125
Nuts.

04:18.666 --> 04:20.875
Come on!

04:21.625 --> 04:23.916
Faster!

04:25.208 --> 04:26.791
Hey!

04:26.958 --> 04:29.833
Chen, wait for me!

04:37.083 --> 04:38.166
Excuse me!

04:40.041 --> 04:42.375
Chen, don't marry him!

04:42.458 --> 04:44.541
-Chen!
-What's wrong?

04:46.958 --> 04:48.500
Don't bother. Get in the car, it's time.

04:49.416 --> 04:52.375
Get out of my way!

04:59.458 --> 05:01.833
Get in the car and chase them!

05:07.291 --> 05:09.541
Chen!

05:09.625 --> 05:11.125
Don't stop the car. This guy is mad!

05:15.541 --> 05:16.541
Chen!

05:18.333 --> 05:22.083
Go away!

05:26.208 --> 05:27.750
I tell you to stop.

05:33.958 --> 05:35.291
Get out!

05:35.416 --> 05:36.583
You crazy, get out!

05:38.041 --> 05:39.166
Get out now!

05:39.250 --> 05:40.416
You get out!

06:02.541 --> 06:03.416
-Chen!
-Let go of her!

06:03.791 --> 06:06.250
Chen, don't be so rash!

06:06.375 --> 06:09.125
Listen to me, you must not marry him!

06:09.375 --> 06:12.250
Why are you stopping me from marrying him?

06:12.583 --> 06:14.916
Why are you breaking us up?

06:17.833 --> 06:19.375
Don't try to run away.

06:20.166 --> 06:22.708
Sorry, I made a mistake.

06:22.916 --> 06:26.541
I wish you a long, happy marriage.

06:31.666 --> 06:34.208
I don't want to see him again, fix him.

06:34.375 --> 06:35.750
Fix him, beat him.

06:39.500 --> 06:41.916
Wait, stay back. Leave him to me.

06:42.625 --> 06:44.708
Fuck you!

07:03.291 --> 07:04.375
Master.

07:04.458 --> 07:06.833
You die or I die.

07:08.000 --> 07:09.208
What the hell?

07:13.333 --> 07:15.875
-Master, what happened to you?
-Jerk, what are you doing here?

07:15.958 --> 07:17.291
Mopping the floor.

07:17.375 --> 07:18.708
Hey!

07:19.541 --> 07:21.291
Don't worry, he won't die.

07:21.375 --> 07:22.500
-Shen.
-Shen.

07:22.625 --> 07:24.458
Ladies, good morning.

07:24.541 --> 07:25.375
Good morning.

07:25.458 --> 07:27.583
Why are you doing laundry?
The washing machine isn't working.

07:27.666 --> 07:29.541
Somebody's repairing it.

07:30.333 --> 07:32.791
Give me the spanner, please.

07:33.750 --> 07:34.666
Thank you.

07:34.750 --> 07:36.916
-Shen, it's been a long time.
-That's right.

07:37.333 --> 07:39.208
-Yes.
-Here I come.

07:39.291 --> 07:40.916
-And you brought something?
-Yes.

07:41.000 --> 07:42.708
Is it for us?

07:42.791 --> 07:44.208
You're so clever, ma'am.

07:44.500 --> 07:47.208
I bought two bottles of magic water
from mainland China.

07:47.291 --> 07:49.583
It's for women,
good for health and beauty.

07:49.666 --> 07:53.416
For men, it can make you a man again.

07:53.500 --> 07:54.458
-Really?
-Really?

07:54.541 --> 07:57.166
I don't need it, save it for yourselves.

07:57.250 --> 08:00.750
Don't you dare reject it.

08:01.291 --> 08:03.125
It's for your sake.

08:03.208 --> 08:04.916
-How much does it cost? We'll pay you.
-Right.

08:05.000 --> 08:08.458
No need, it's very cheap.

08:08.958 --> 08:10.958
-We're like family, no need.
-Of course, we should pay.

08:11.041 --> 08:13.833
-Take it, it's okay.
-No...

08:14.750 --> 08:17.791
When I said 20 to 30 cents,
I meant two to three thousand.

08:17.875 --> 08:21.625
All right, we're family, just take it.

08:23.791 --> 08:27.166
You worked so hard to earn 30 cents?

08:27.375 --> 08:28.416
Never mind.

08:29.708 --> 08:31.500
I barely see you now.

08:31.708 --> 08:33.291
Busy going out with Chen?

08:33.791 --> 08:36.750
Don't mention Chen again. I dumped her.

08:37.125 --> 08:38.083
Why?

08:38.458 --> 08:40.625
Why not? She's...

08:40.708 --> 08:44.041
Snobbish, slutty, and low class.

08:44.166 --> 08:45.416
Who's talking behind our backs?

08:46.041 --> 08:47.083
It's him.

08:47.166 --> 08:50.250
No, I'm talking
about the bitch downstairs.

08:50.416 --> 08:52.750
She's good at seducing men.

08:52.833 --> 08:53.791
Yes.

08:54.125 --> 08:55.083
-Damn you.
-Wait.

08:56.708 --> 08:58.666
-Spend them wisely.
-Oh, thank you.

09:00.416 --> 09:01.291
Master,

09:01.750 --> 09:05.500
ever since I left
the orphanage with you...

09:05.583 --> 09:06.875
No, I don't have a light.

09:07.791 --> 09:11.083
You never taught me how to get a girl.

09:11.791 --> 09:13.833
Girls? Don't mention it again.

09:14.000 --> 09:16.625
If I had been careful about girls,

09:16.875 --> 09:18.666
I wouldn't have been so lousy today.

09:18.833 --> 09:20.958
The four beauties there,
I chased and got them in a day.

09:21.041 --> 09:23.375
They are my wives now,
and they are playing mahjong together.

09:23.458 --> 09:25.250
So what?

09:25.375 --> 09:26.208
Good.

09:26.375 --> 09:28.375
Good, okay, you can have them all.

09:28.458 --> 09:29.333
I said, good God.

09:29.416 --> 09:30.708
Good, now you understand.

09:30.916 --> 09:33.041
So, men like us

09:33.458 --> 09:35.625
should never talk about love.

09:36.041 --> 09:37.958
We only talk about money.

09:39.208 --> 09:42.958
For money, we should be bloodless.

09:43.708 --> 09:44.750
That far? Really?

09:44.833 --> 09:46.000
Do you want to be outstanding?

09:46.083 --> 09:46.916
Yes.

09:47.000 --> 09:50.083
Then listen to me, be bloodless.

09:51.625 --> 09:52.500
I got it, master.

09:52.583 --> 09:54.250
Good.

09:56.333 --> 09:57.333
What are you doing?

09:57.416 --> 09:58.333
Give me back 30 cents.

09:58.416 --> 09:59.916
-What?
-Pretend no more, give them back.

10:00.000 --> 10:01.541
No, I didn't.

10:01.625 --> 10:03.083
You didn't? You old fool.

10:03.166 --> 10:05.166
Give me back 30 cents! Now!

10:12.625 --> 10:16.041
Good, kid, you learned it from me.

10:16.125 --> 10:17.833
You will be great.

10:21.583 --> 10:23.583
-Taxi!
-I got here first.

10:23.666 --> 10:26.000
-It's mine.
-Mine!

10:26.166 --> 10:30.125
-I came here first!
-I'm old, I have priority.

10:32.041 --> 10:33.708
-The taxi's mine.
-Help me!

10:33.875 --> 10:35.708
Help!

10:36.250 --> 10:39.125
Please, somebody, help me.

10:41.916 --> 10:43.708
-Are you all right?
-What a pity.

10:43.791 --> 10:47.250
-How can I help you?
-I'm all right. You're all very kind.

10:47.500 --> 10:50.708
I'm in a hurry for the hospital

10:50.875 --> 10:53.041
to receive a transplant surgery.

10:53.208 --> 10:56.458
I can't get a taxi. Is this a taxi?

10:56.541 --> 10:58.375
-Taxi? No.
-Taxi? No.

10:58.625 --> 11:02.458
Shit, it's my taxi, how dare you?

11:04.166 --> 11:05.291
Aim for those eyes.

11:07.666 --> 11:08.791
Get going!

11:11.208 --> 11:13.041
-That bitch got it.
-How unfair.

11:13.125 --> 11:14.833
-Yes.
-What now?

11:15.250 --> 11:16.916
What now? Get another one!

11:27.375 --> 11:30.250
Hello, do you need a drive?

11:30.333 --> 11:31.583
I'll give you a ride.

11:32.333 --> 11:34.625
It's so kind of you.

11:38.208 --> 11:41.041
It's hard to find someone empathetic
like you in Hong Kong.

11:41.541 --> 11:42.916
It's hard to get a taxi here.

11:43.166 --> 11:44.875
And we should help the disabled.

11:44.958 --> 11:45.833
Thank you.

11:46.125 --> 11:47.958
-Where are you going?
-The Hong Kong-Macau Harbor.

11:48.291 --> 11:49.291
To pick a friend up?

11:51.416 --> 11:54.583
I got some money for a game there.

11:56.208 --> 11:57.291
Gambling by hearing?

12:03.291 --> 12:04.916
I hope I'm that good.

12:20.041 --> 12:21.375
May I know the time, please?

12:23.208 --> 12:24.166
It's 2:30.

12:24.250 --> 12:26.541
Oh, we can still make it.

12:26.625 --> 12:28.916
Is this car moving?

12:29.000 --> 12:30.708
-Yes.
-I'm just asking.

12:30.791 --> 12:31.666
We're moving.

12:31.750 --> 12:33.500
-Then hurry up, thank you.
-All right.

12:43.041 --> 12:44.208
What happened?

12:44.416 --> 12:45.500
I ran someone down.

12:46.208 --> 12:48.291
Hey, how are you?

12:49.250 --> 12:50.708
Goodness! Ma'am, how are you?

12:50.791 --> 12:55.708
It hurts. My leg's broken.
Blood's everywhere. I need compensation.

12:56.625 --> 12:59.166
I don't have enough money, wait.

12:59.916 --> 13:02.666
Sir, can you lend me some money now?
I need to pay her.

13:03.875 --> 13:05.833
-Who?
-An old lady I hit.

13:06.333 --> 13:07.583
Let me have a look.

13:08.625 --> 13:10.875
Ma'am, where are you?

13:10.958 --> 13:14.500
It hurts. Give me compensation.

13:14.583 --> 13:16.125
You want compensation?

13:16.208 --> 13:18.791
-Yes. It hurts so much.
-Are you dying?

13:18.875 --> 13:21.500
I'll get the police if you don't pay me.

13:21.875 --> 13:24.666
No, the police aren't here.
We will wait for them.

13:26.291 --> 13:27.833
There's a police officer here.

13:27.916 --> 13:30.250
-Where?
-I'm a police officer!

13:31.125 --> 13:33.958
Ma'am, your leg is broken and bleeding.
How did that happen?

13:34.125 --> 13:35.875
Blind man, you hit her?
You should pay her.

13:36.291 --> 13:37.333
What if I don't pay?

13:37.416 --> 13:39.041
I'll arrest you, aren't you afraid?

13:39.791 --> 13:42.250
Why? I'm not going to die.

13:42.333 --> 13:44.083
You can't shoot me here, right?

13:44.166 --> 13:47.166
You think you're the Liberation Army?

13:47.375 --> 13:49.291
-I'll get the Liberation Army.
-Impossible!

13:49.708 --> 13:50.666
Bastard.

13:52.458 --> 13:54.041
Blind man, what are you doing here?

13:54.958 --> 13:56.750
He hit her but he won't pay.

13:56.833 --> 13:59.458
Pay, or I'll shoot you here!

13:59.541 --> 14:01.041
I don't know Mandarin.

14:02.541 --> 14:05.958
He told you to pay, or he will kill you!

14:06.250 --> 14:08.625
Pay, or I'll shoot you here!

14:09.041 --> 14:12.541
Whatever. The gun can kill me in a second.

14:12.625 --> 14:15.750
I'm afraid of a dog biting me to death.

14:16.166 --> 14:17.083
There's a dog.

14:17.166 --> 14:18.458
What a coincidence.

14:24.333 --> 14:25.875
Hey, doggie, why are you barking?

14:25.958 --> 14:28.875
Telling you to pay quickly,
or I'll bite you to death.

14:29.291 --> 14:30.291
Please don't.

14:31.583 --> 14:34.083
It's pathetic to be killed by you.

14:35.958 --> 14:37.708
You played blind to fool me.

14:37.791 --> 14:39.958
Right, I pretended to be blind.

14:40.291 --> 14:42.375
I can't pretend I'm a dog or something.

14:42.458 --> 14:43.666
I can't do that.

14:45.166 --> 14:49.416
Sir, then we are both playing it smart--

14:49.500 --> 14:52.041
I play it smart, and you play like a dog.

14:52.125 --> 14:53.916
We better draw the line.

14:54.166 --> 14:57.625
Sir, I owed them a lot.

14:58.291 --> 15:01.958
They will get me if I don't pay back.

15:03.250 --> 15:04.666
Show some tears for that.

15:04.750 --> 15:06.625
Wait, I will.

15:06.708 --> 15:07.541
For how long?

15:07.625 --> 15:09.291
One second.

15:11.625 --> 15:14.541
You can't even pass the test
as an actress.

15:14.833 --> 15:17.041
How could you join this trade?

15:17.125 --> 15:19.166
Let me teach you some tricks.

15:19.250 --> 15:20.125
All right.

15:20.208 --> 15:21.791
Right on this road,

15:21.875 --> 15:24.833
get down before a car
and pretend you're hit.

15:24.916 --> 15:26.000
Then you got a chance.

15:26.125 --> 15:27.166
Watch out.

15:35.875 --> 15:36.958
How are you?

15:38.250 --> 15:39.416
Watch and learn.

15:39.875 --> 15:43.333
My leg is broken, what now?

15:50.041 --> 15:54.375
My car is damaged, too, what now?

15:55.416 --> 15:56.416
It's easy.

15:58.083 --> 15:59.916
One thousand dollars for your car

16:00.166 --> 16:02.375
and another one thousand
for my admiration for you.

16:02.458 --> 16:04.208
What about your leg?

16:05.041 --> 16:08.583
No worries, I should have died
crossing the road blindly.

16:08.666 --> 16:10.083
You only broke my leg.

16:10.666 --> 16:11.875
I don't know how to thank you.

16:12.041 --> 16:12.916
Get me to hospital.

16:15.833 --> 16:18.291
Good luck to you!

16:20.750 --> 16:23.583
Weird, that trick is--

16:23.666 --> 16:24.958
See?

16:25.458 --> 16:26.916
I taught you one more trick.

16:27.166 --> 16:30.250
Drive on the road as you please.

16:30.333 --> 16:32.083
Find a fool who crosses the road blindly.

16:32.166 --> 16:34.833
Go and hit him, then ask for compensation.

16:35.041 --> 16:37.041
You see what an example I've shown you?

16:37.125 --> 16:38.708
You know it always works.

16:39.750 --> 16:42.083
You're a genius.

16:42.166 --> 16:43.291
You got my admiration.

16:43.416 --> 16:44.625
Then pay for the tuition.

16:44.708 --> 16:46.833
There's 5,000 for tuition,
and 10,000 for demonstration.

16:46.916 --> 16:48.041
It's a total of 17,000 dollars.

16:48.333 --> 16:49.875
I think it's 15,000 dollars.

16:49.958 --> 16:52.625
But I paid 2,000 dollars for you. Wake up!

16:53.041 --> 16:54.875
-I have no money.
-No?

16:55.416 --> 16:59.416
-I really have none. I don't have it I...
-Quit acting. Hurry up and pay!

17:01.125 --> 17:04.958
Stop searching, I don't have money.

17:05.875 --> 17:07.458
Where do you live?
Go home and get the money.

17:09.333 --> 17:15.166
I don't have a home,
and my boyfriend dumped me.

17:15.375 --> 17:18.916
Now I'm alone and helpless.

17:20.166 --> 17:23.666
I only got this watch, it's from my mom.

17:24.083 --> 17:27.458
You can take it as a down payment.

17:27.583 --> 17:29.208
I'll pay to get it back when I got money.

17:30.166 --> 17:32.708
Save it for yourself, I'm unlucky today.

17:33.041 --> 17:34.833
Thank you.

17:38.041 --> 17:41.375
Bitch, I've been looking for you.
Pay me back!

17:41.875 --> 17:44.916
-Hey! Stay right there.
-Hey! Stay right there.

17:53.041 --> 17:54.541
-Stop.
-Now, where are you going?

17:55.333 --> 17:56.416
Let me go.

17:59.125 --> 18:00.041
It's not so easy.

18:00.666 --> 18:01.583
Don't cry.

18:02.458 --> 18:04.500
-Let me go.
-Come here.

18:04.666 --> 18:05.541
Hey.

18:06.541 --> 18:07.458
Fool.

18:09.458 --> 18:10.333
Walk faster!

18:16.000 --> 18:16.958
Bitch!

18:17.541 --> 18:19.958
You still don't have the money,
and you try to run?

18:20.750 --> 18:21.958
I'll teach a lesson!

18:22.250 --> 18:23.333
What are you doing?

18:24.375 --> 18:28.583
Let go of my girlfriend,
or I'll call the police.

18:30.875 --> 18:34.750
You got a blind man as a boyfriend,
that's bad.

18:35.333 --> 18:38.416
Trying to fool me, damned blind man.

18:39.458 --> 18:41.916
Don't do it again.

18:42.583 --> 18:43.958
Stand still.

18:55.291 --> 19:00.458
You ducked all these, great job.

19:07.083 --> 19:08.291
So you are--

19:08.375 --> 19:09.375
That's right.

19:11.208 --> 19:12.333
I am

19:12.958 --> 19:15.916
The Blind Knight.

19:17.666 --> 19:18.750
The Blind Knight?

19:19.083 --> 19:20.625
You're tough.

19:21.708 --> 19:22.541
Let's go.

19:28.208 --> 19:32.666
Such big eyes. He can see, boss!

19:33.916 --> 19:35.291
Why didn't you make it this time?

19:35.375 --> 19:36.958
I was rolling my eyes to play blind.

19:37.166 --> 19:39.083
Let the boss teach you a lesson.

19:51.875 --> 19:53.958
Boss, you are so tough.

19:54.083 --> 19:56.375
You're awesome with a sword.

19:56.458 --> 20:00.000
I admire you, boss.

20:01.166 --> 20:02.041
What, boss?

20:02.541 --> 20:04.958
You're so scared that you sweat.

20:06.333 --> 20:10.041
You could even read my fear.

20:10.125 --> 20:13.375
This sword has been used for hara-kiri.

20:15.208 --> 20:18.500
Hara-kiri... It takes great courage.

20:20.791 --> 20:21.666
Where's the boss?

20:22.041 --> 20:23.041
There.

20:27.375 --> 20:28.666
Who killed you?

20:28.750 --> 20:31.375
Tell me, l will avenge you.

20:31.458 --> 20:33.083
Tell me, who killed you?

20:40.416 --> 20:42.041
You fool me, too.

20:44.875 --> 20:46.875
You play tricks with me, kid.

20:50.541 --> 20:53.458
I'll kill you if you're not my brother.

20:56.916 --> 20:58.375
Who are those two?

20:59.208 --> 21:02.583
The girl refused to pay,
and the guy backed her up.

21:02.708 --> 21:04.083
Actually...

21:05.791 --> 21:08.583
Actually, I'm not her boyfriend.
It's a misunderstanding.

21:08.666 --> 21:11.041
Who cares? Can you pay back the money?

21:12.125 --> 21:13.291
Yes.

21:13.750 --> 21:15.583
I'll pay just a bit later, right?

21:15.666 --> 21:18.291
That's a no. Take photos of her.

21:21.333 --> 21:22.458
What the hell?

21:22.541 --> 21:23.750
I have nothing to do with this.

21:23.833 --> 21:25.000
-Why am I involved?
-Look here.

21:26.875 --> 21:29.291
-This is all your fault.
-Listen, I'll pay soon.

21:30.125 --> 21:30.958
Bitch.

21:31.208 --> 21:32.458
You have seven days.

21:32.666 --> 21:34.041
If you can't pay by then,

21:37.291 --> 21:39.875
you will be like this picture.

21:42.541 --> 21:44.250
It's a good picture.

21:44.500 --> 21:45.416
Right, good pose.

21:45.500 --> 21:46.708
-I know, right?
-Throw them out.

21:46.791 --> 21:48.291
Go.

21:48.500 --> 21:50.083
-I don't even know her.
-Go.

21:50.166 --> 21:51.208
Now! Hurry up.

21:51.291 --> 21:52.666
Go.

21:52.833 --> 21:53.916
You go, too.

21:57.500 --> 21:59.416
Boss, he told the truth.

21:59.666 --> 22:00.500
Take him here.

22:05.166 --> 22:07.375
It's suffocating!

22:22.125 --> 22:24.041
Your plastic surgery is quite good!

22:24.125 --> 22:27.291
It won't come off even after three hours
in the sauna. So you admit it now?

22:28.708 --> 22:29.833
I admit it.

22:31.416 --> 22:33.750
You used to look so handsome.

22:34.083 --> 22:36.333
Why did you have surgery for this shit?

22:36.625 --> 22:38.958
I had no other choice.

22:39.375 --> 22:41.958
-Please spare me.
-So that means you can return it?

22:42.166 --> 22:45.166
Of course, I'll return the money.

22:45.625 --> 22:47.333
Please give me a few more days.

22:47.666 --> 22:50.625
I have something to propose to you

22:50.958 --> 22:52.791
since both of us are friends.

22:54.208 --> 22:58.125
The owner of this house
is on vacation for a month.

22:58.833 --> 23:01.375
Go and get those antiques for me.

23:01.708 --> 23:05.916
You're telling me to steal for you?

23:06.125 --> 23:08.208
Cheating is all I do.

23:09.708 --> 23:12.083
Put him back in the sauna
for a few more hours.

23:12.500 --> 23:15.625
No. We can negotiate.

23:15.750 --> 23:16.875
That's the right attitude.

23:17.583 --> 23:19.958
You get the antiques for me,
and you can take the furniture.

23:20.041 --> 23:23.125
You sell them and pay me back.

23:24.166 --> 23:26.958
The house is huge.
There must be maids in there.

23:27.583 --> 23:29.291
You're smart. What's the problem?

23:29.375 --> 23:31.166
That's not a big deal, expert.

23:31.250 --> 23:32.708
It's all sorted out.

23:36.333 --> 23:38.000
What have I done wrong?

23:39.791 --> 23:41.500
I'm punished for my good deed.

23:41.833 --> 23:44.208
Sorry, I'll return the favor.

23:44.291 --> 23:46.708
I don't want to see you again. Get lost.

23:47.750 --> 23:48.625
Get lost.

23:49.583 --> 23:50.541
Get lost now!

23:51.083 --> 23:52.291
Now!

23:52.750 --> 23:56.375
Bitch! You really went away!

23:56.458 --> 23:58.083
You can't just walk away like that.

23:59.416 --> 24:01.125
You sort things out for me.

24:01.208 --> 24:03.750
I'll be killed too if you don't pay.

24:04.458 --> 24:06.458
I'm sorry. I'll make it up to you.

24:06.541 --> 24:07.916
How will you make it up to me?

24:08.291 --> 24:09.833
-I got it.
-Got what?

24:09.916 --> 24:11.500
-I can do it.
-What can you do?

24:11.583 --> 24:13.250
-I'll do it now.
-Hey!

24:23.375 --> 24:28.416
-My leg is broken. Pay me.
-Can you even drive?

24:28.625 --> 24:33.833
-It's broken. Where's the money?
-My car is damaged!

24:35.291 --> 24:39.125
-It hurts. Pay me for this.
-What the hell?

24:39.208 --> 24:42.500
Pay me. My leg is broken.

24:42.666 --> 24:45.541
-Bitch, what are you even doing?
-Oh no, how did this happen?

24:46.666 --> 24:47.750
Pay me the compensation.

24:48.291 --> 24:49.916
-Pay me the compensation.
-What for?

24:50.208 --> 24:52.583
-Hey, don't go!
-Look after my car.

24:52.750 --> 24:54.791
-Look after my car.
-You bastard.

24:54.875 --> 24:56.083
See how damaged my car is.

24:56.958 --> 24:59.625
Though you are an idiot,

24:59.708 --> 25:03.208
who has a plain figure
that's wearing an old-fashioned outfit,

25:03.416 --> 25:04.833
you're trustworthy and brave.

25:04.916 --> 25:07.083
I'll teach you something.

25:07.166 --> 25:08.125
Thank you.

25:08.458 --> 25:10.291
-Remember the plan?
-I do.

25:10.375 --> 25:12.708
We go in and take things.
Aren't we thieves?

25:12.791 --> 25:14.583
We are thieves if nobody is in there.

25:14.666 --> 25:16.166
It is playing smart if there's somebody.

25:16.500 --> 25:18.750
The beginning is always the hardest.

25:18.833 --> 25:21.708
Now, let's see how to get there.

25:21.791 --> 25:24.750
It takes true wisdom and great courage.

25:24.833 --> 25:26.875
-I got them.
-Those are things that you lack.

25:26.958 --> 25:28.083
Look how I do it. Ring the bell.

25:31.041 --> 25:32.083
Take it easy.

25:33.875 --> 25:35.833
Come on in.

25:36.333 --> 25:37.250
We are...

25:38.541 --> 25:40.500
Come on in.

25:42.375 --> 25:43.208
Quick.

25:48.083 --> 25:49.000
What are you doing here?

25:49.083 --> 25:50.375
We got a complaint...

25:54.208 --> 25:55.833
Quiet. Don't wake my wife up.

25:57.333 --> 25:59.416
We got a complaint about a gas leakage.

25:59.500 --> 26:00.708
Such a strong smell.

26:02.125 --> 26:05.583
-Yes, follow me to the kitchen.
-What?

26:06.833 --> 26:08.625
-Look for expensive things.
-I know.

26:08.708 --> 26:09.791
-Here's the switch.
-Yes.

26:17.541 --> 26:20.250
-How is it going?
-Hold this for me.

26:22.541 --> 26:23.875
You hear that sound?

26:24.750 --> 26:26.875
Yes. The smell of gas is strong.

26:27.083 --> 26:29.541
It seems serious. I'll call for help now.

26:31.708 --> 26:32.875
Stay there.

26:43.625 --> 26:46.708
-What the--
-It's dangerous. She was holding a knife.

26:46.833 --> 26:48.708
Don't fear. Nobody's here.

26:48.791 --> 26:50.208
Take some things and go.

26:51.666 --> 26:54.166
You didn't have to kill her.

26:54.416 --> 26:55.416
I...

26:56.000 --> 26:57.416
How could you laugh at that?

26:57.833 --> 26:59.375
I...

26:59.500 --> 27:00.750
You're cruel.

27:04.500 --> 27:06.416
You always mess things up.

27:24.500 --> 27:25.875
Shit. I was holding a knife.

27:25.958 --> 27:29.333
What the hell? You killed two?
I'm calling the police.

27:30.375 --> 27:32.541
Shut up and listen to me.

27:33.500 --> 27:36.875
What do you have to say?

27:37.375 --> 27:39.375
-Will you please leave me alone?
-I didn't see the knife.

27:39.458 --> 27:40.708
You want to kill me too?

27:48.875 --> 27:50.125
No...

27:53.500 --> 27:55.416
No...

28:06.708 --> 28:07.958
What are you doing?

28:09.541 --> 28:10.833
It hurts.

28:12.125 --> 28:14.666
Honey, what are they doing here?

28:16.541 --> 28:18.583
They came to repair the gas pipe.

28:18.666 --> 28:21.500
Right, we're here
because of a gas leakage.

28:21.583 --> 28:23.583
-Is it fixed?
-I fixed it. What about you?

28:24.250 --> 28:27.708
-Let's go. Sorry for disturbing you.
-No problem.

28:28.833 --> 28:32.375
You idiot. Why did you let them in?

28:38.291 --> 28:40.083
Why didn't you tell me?

28:40.583 --> 28:43.041
-You've been holding my neck.
-How can I talk like that?

28:43.125 --> 28:44.916
Of course, you can talk. Stupid.

28:46.875 --> 28:48.500
It's one day closer to payment.

28:49.708 --> 28:53.083
We need to put in some capital.
Go and buy two tickets for Sara's concert.

28:53.250 --> 28:54.291
What for?

28:55.041 --> 28:57.750
To put them in somebody's mailbox.
Everybody likes things that are free.

28:57.833 --> 29:00.833
They will go to the concert,
and nobody will be home then.

29:00.916 --> 29:04.041
That's our time then, burglar.

29:04.625 --> 29:06.166
No one is there. We will be thieves then.

29:07.666 --> 29:11.083
I'm smart enough to make them leave,
so that's still playing it smart.

29:11.958 --> 29:12.833
And our target is?

29:18.458 --> 29:19.333
This one.

29:27.666 --> 29:29.666
-Wait, I'll just lock the door.
-Where are we going today?

29:29.916 --> 29:31.041
We're going to Macau.

29:31.125 --> 29:33.375
-Really? But my boss might get mad.
-It's great in Macau.

29:33.458 --> 29:36.250
-No way, leave everything to me.
-Well, okay, if you say so.

29:36.333 --> 29:38.375
-We won't take long, okay?
-Of course.

29:38.875 --> 29:39.958
I got you, don't worry.

29:49.541 --> 29:51.208
CHAN SING CLEANING SERVICES

29:54.083 --> 29:56.458
This guy is smart.

29:56.875 --> 29:59.000
-He's smooth with girls.
-Shut up, get in.

30:00.708 --> 30:01.541
Come on.

30:04.083 --> 30:08.375
Wow, this is a big and beautiful house.

30:08.708 --> 30:10.916
Don't look around.

30:11.916 --> 30:13.666
For you. Be swift.

30:27.541 --> 30:30.750
This is a pre-recorded audio.
Please leave your message.

30:31.541 --> 30:34.666
Chen, I got to know
a tycoon's son called Jackie.

30:34.791 --> 30:37.125
He's coming to Hong Kong
for an investment.

30:37.250 --> 30:40.333
Show hospitality, and you get tips for it.

30:42.416 --> 30:44.041
-Glad it didn't break.
-Wait.

30:44.791 --> 30:47.750
Put the things back.
I have an easy way to gain wealth.

30:48.208 --> 30:49.416
Hurry up.

30:49.916 --> 30:51.041
How may I help you?

30:52.583 --> 30:55.708
-The head is coming back next month.
-We got time to set up a trap.

30:55.791 --> 30:58.583
-I'll pretend to be the head.
-And fool that Jackie.

30:59.250 --> 31:01.041
The antiques will be ours then.

31:01.125 --> 31:03.208
Then we fool that Jackie.

31:03.291 --> 31:06.000
It's a shame if we just let a chance go.

31:06.250 --> 31:08.666
Boss, it's a good idea, right?

31:09.000 --> 31:10.750
-I think the same way as you do.
-I got it first.

31:10.833 --> 31:13.458
No good idea could possibly come from him.

31:14.125 --> 31:17.583
But since we're friends, I can help you.

31:17.958 --> 31:19.833
And the money's share would be...

31:19.916 --> 31:21.333
Half and half.

31:21.416 --> 31:23.708
-Really?
-You may borrow the antiques too.

31:24.333 --> 31:27.541
You're so kind to me.

31:27.708 --> 31:29.166
Do your best.

31:29.416 --> 31:32.541
Of course. I won't disappoint you.

31:33.666 --> 31:36.625
Why should we share with him equally?

31:36.916 --> 31:39.208
It can make him try his best.

31:39.333 --> 31:41.416
Fifty percent is still too much for it.

31:41.583 --> 31:44.375
The rent for the antiques is just 50%.

31:45.416 --> 31:48.750
Wow, then it comes back to us in the end.

31:49.416 --> 31:51.750
You're smart.

31:55.333 --> 31:56.666
-Hey, Fa.
-Fa.

31:56.750 --> 31:58.500
-Call me sir.
-Yes, sir.

31:58.708 --> 32:01.333
Sir, I found several concert tickets.

32:01.416 --> 32:04.666
Don't be greedy, it will cost you.

32:04.958 --> 32:06.791
Remember, go to work on time.

32:06.875 --> 32:08.750
-Yes, sir.
-Got it.

32:14.958 --> 32:16.708
All we need now is a wife.

32:17.708 --> 32:20.708
-Who is she?
-Wow, she's challenging a man.

32:21.625 --> 32:22.666
-All right.
-She will lose.

32:23.083 --> 32:26.333
-Come at me.
-Fatty, I'll bet on you.

32:27.000 --> 32:29.416
One, two, go.

32:32.250 --> 32:35.500
-Wow.
-You helped me win again.

32:36.291 --> 32:37.625
-What? You think he cheated?
-Yes.

32:37.708 --> 32:40.000
-Let's do it again.
-Let's do it.

32:40.083 --> 32:41.666
-You think you will win this time?
-Why not?

32:41.833 --> 32:43.208
I don't believe it.

32:43.291 --> 32:44.458
Come at me.

32:47.958 --> 32:51.750
Ping, no one buys it anymore.

32:51.833 --> 32:53.958
-Let's just call it a day.
-We can't catch a break here.

32:55.125 --> 32:56.750
Ping, we're leaving then.

32:56.958 --> 32:58.000
See you, Ping.

33:08.875 --> 33:11.291
Who's playing tricks on me?

33:12.083 --> 33:13.208
Who?

33:13.375 --> 33:14.333
It's me.

33:17.833 --> 33:19.083
It's you.

33:19.291 --> 33:20.708
It's me, of course.

33:21.416 --> 33:22.833
It's really you?

33:23.875 --> 33:26.375
I'm in bad mood, don't try me.

33:27.250 --> 33:29.291
You don't recognize me? I'm Fa.

33:30.458 --> 33:32.083
-Are you really Fa?
-Yes.

33:35.000 --> 33:36.166
No, stop!

33:36.916 --> 33:38.750
Spare my life. Look at your bra first.

33:38.833 --> 33:40.875
There's a coin.

33:41.541 --> 33:44.541
That's the French coin you gave me.

33:44.666 --> 33:46.333
Look carefully.

33:50.250 --> 33:51.458
It's Fa.

33:52.458 --> 33:54.791
-You are Fa?
-I am.

33:55.000 --> 33:56.875
You should've told me earlier.

33:57.583 --> 33:59.083
What are you all looking at?

34:03.250 --> 34:05.250
What happened to your face?

34:05.458 --> 34:08.291
I did it to hide.

34:09.500 --> 34:10.958
Why did you come to see me?

34:11.458 --> 34:13.958
I come to you for...

34:14.916 --> 34:17.833
If you want me to lend you money,
then no. I could barely sustain myself.

34:18.166 --> 34:20.666
You're kidding, we're old friends.

34:21.625 --> 34:23.875
We were friends because you were hot then.

34:23.958 --> 34:26.666
Now you look bad, we talk business only.

34:27.625 --> 34:29.666
I have business to discuss with you.

34:31.416 --> 34:33.250
Trust me, it's profitable.

34:35.625 --> 34:36.875
Are you really Fa?

34:46.500 --> 34:49.500
I told you I can't drink.

34:54.875 --> 34:56.166
I can't drink at all.

34:58.208 --> 35:00.541
You're naughty. I said no.

35:00.625 --> 35:02.250
Naughty? Am I?

35:03.125 --> 35:05.166
Am I?

35:12.875 --> 35:14.541
Nobody's in the house now.

35:16.791 --> 35:17.833
-How are you, dying?
-No.

35:19.250 --> 35:21.458
Give me all the credit cards.

35:21.833 --> 35:22.958
What for?

35:23.916 --> 35:26.083
To open the door.

35:26.375 --> 35:28.291
It takes skills and steady hands.

35:30.583 --> 35:33.958
Where's my card, it's a rare one
I picked it up on the street.

35:34.166 --> 35:36.625
Picked it up? You gave me a false one.

35:36.708 --> 35:37.541
How did you know?

35:37.625 --> 35:39.750
It's stuck in the door.
You tell me whether it's fake or not!

35:39.833 --> 35:40.875
Any more cards?

35:42.375 --> 35:44.208
-A train ticket.
-Give it to me, is this authentic?

35:44.291 --> 35:45.666
-Yes.
-Really?

35:47.541 --> 35:49.541
Look, it opens.

35:56.500 --> 35:58.208
We're rich.

35:59.375 --> 36:02.291
-What are you doing?
-This must be something worthy.

36:03.083 --> 36:04.750
Do you think you can move that?

36:07.875 --> 36:09.125
I can move this.

36:09.208 --> 36:11.416
Get something you can put inside your bag.

36:11.833 --> 36:14.958
This one, for example. Give me the bag.

36:17.666 --> 36:19.000
Over here?

36:19.625 --> 36:22.250
-I meant the upper pocket, not this one.
-No pockets, just two holes.

36:23.500 --> 36:25.291
These two? What kind of bag is this?

36:25.375 --> 36:28.625
This is not a bag. It's a wallet.
One for keys, one for coins.

36:29.500 --> 36:31.416
-A wallet?
-It's cool, right?

36:45.416 --> 36:46.541
What happened?

36:47.083 --> 36:48.333
Are you okay?

36:49.791 --> 36:51.416
Okay, time's running short.

36:51.541 --> 36:54.791
You look around for things that
can fit in this bag.

36:55.083 --> 36:57.125
I got it. For example?

36:58.541 --> 37:01.625
Expensive pens, lighters, ashtrays.

37:01.708 --> 37:02.750
Got it.

37:05.250 --> 37:06.958
I found one.

37:07.125 --> 37:08.916
Look, a luxury ashtray.

37:09.000 --> 37:14.083
Hold that bag wide open, come on. Wider.

37:15.958 --> 37:18.208
-What? Something on your mind?
-Right.

37:18.291 --> 37:19.875
-Tell me.
-I don't feel like it.

37:20.041 --> 37:22.041
-Any other way to express it?
-Yes.

37:30.291 --> 37:31.625
Hey!

37:32.833 --> 37:35.958
You act as my wife now. Walk behind me.

37:38.083 --> 37:39.166
Follow me.

37:39.625 --> 37:42.625
Watch your manners. Walk steadily

37:42.750 --> 37:48.416
and speak gently like a rich wife.

37:51.625 --> 37:54.166
Ping!

37:55.166 --> 37:57.125
It's you who's playing my husband.

37:57.666 --> 38:00.833
You walk behind me. Chest up.

38:01.333 --> 38:02.458
Eyes wide open.

38:03.916 --> 38:07.125
Then you're like a rich husband, got it?

38:07.291 --> 38:08.250
Got it!

38:10.708 --> 38:13.375
I don't believe there's not even
one thing I can put into this bag.

38:13.458 --> 38:14.958
Yes, try it again.

38:16.250 --> 38:17.458
This one.

38:17.833 --> 38:18.750
Don't move!

38:21.458 --> 38:22.958
Hey, that's my favorite.

38:23.041 --> 38:25.333
-Lee.
-Bullshit, that's Dumb Boy.

38:25.416 --> 38:26.500
Lee.

38:26.583 --> 38:29.000
-Dumb Boy.
-Dumb boy he is then.

38:29.416 --> 38:31.041
Say it again, you bastards!

38:31.875 --> 38:32.875
What now?

38:32.958 --> 38:35.208
Try to find a bigger bag.

38:36.666 --> 38:40.083
This is a pre-recorded audio.
Please leave your message.

38:40.625 --> 38:44.291
Chen, that Jackie I mentioned,
he will be one week late.

38:44.583 --> 38:46.875
-I'll call you when it's set.
-Oh, we're screwed.

38:47.125 --> 38:48.375
None of your business.

38:48.750 --> 38:51.791
Look, the concert tickets are here.

38:52.625 --> 38:54.666
The owner will come back anytime. Run.

38:57.666 --> 39:00.958
Mrs. Huang!

39:02.416 --> 39:03.625
What now?

39:03.916 --> 39:05.625
Where can we get a Mrs. Huang?

39:05.750 --> 39:07.875
-Mrs. Huang?
-What now?

39:08.541 --> 39:10.208
-Act.
-Who's doing the acting?

39:10.291 --> 39:11.458
You, of course!

39:13.166 --> 39:14.333
Something is wrong.

39:15.541 --> 39:17.083
-Yes, I'll contact the HQ.
-Okay.

39:21.375 --> 39:22.291
Who are you?

39:24.458 --> 39:26.083
-Are you Mrs. Huang?
-Yes.

39:27.541 --> 39:31.291
Excuse me, but somebody complained
about your noise.

39:31.750 --> 39:35.666
-Honey, come to bed.
-We hope...

39:36.416 --> 39:40.125
Please pay attention next time.
Good night.

39:40.333 --> 39:41.625
Okay, bye.

39:46.208 --> 39:50.583
Ping, we can quit after this one.

39:51.000 --> 39:52.791
We? Why we?

39:53.750 --> 39:55.583
We're the best duo.

39:57.375 --> 39:58.916
We were.

39:59.458 --> 40:02.791
-That's history.
-I know you're nostalgic.

40:03.375 --> 40:06.250
So I kept the coin.
I knew you wouldn't recognize me.

40:06.375 --> 40:08.625
But you were so happy
when you saw that coin.

40:08.750 --> 40:10.500
I know you still miss me.

40:12.291 --> 40:14.416
-Are you talking about this?
-Right.

40:15.083 --> 40:16.916
Wait. Why did you do that?

